config GMK70_POWER
	bool "GMK70 coordinated native sleep and runtime storage"
	depends on GMK70_CONTROLS && GMK70_RADIO
	default y
	select HAS_POWEROFF
	select ZMK_SLEEP
	select ZMK_PM_SOFT_OFF
	help
	  Native inactivity and power-off policy with existing WB32 STOP/wake
	  hardware and the stock radio's own sleep firmware. Both halves must
	  advertise the coordinated power protocol before joined sleep is used.
	  Runtime preference saves use an idle storage lease; updater and Studio
	  writes retain their existing wired/USB authorization.
